/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.tmp
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local agent state — track only the shared bits.
# `.claude/skills/` and `.kiro/skills/` are checked in so repo-scoped
# skills (docs-sync, etc.) travel with the codebase. Per-user state
# (settings.local.json, etc.) stays local.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.kiro/*
!.kiro/skills/

# Planning / analysis docs written during a working session. These are
# working notes, not part of the published contract — the README and
# CHANGELOG are. Keep them on disk, out of the repo.
/framework_integration.md
/*_plan.md
/*-plan.md

# Python bytecode from scripts/
__pycache__/
